  "description": "Charts for .NET MAUI: LineChart (a time series over a target band, with gaps, bands between two series, a live point and summer/winter time on the axis), RingChart (a share as a ring, clockwise from 12 o'clock), BarChart (a share as a bar) ColumnChart (values per day or category as columns with labels) and ChartScroller (a line or column chart scrolled back through its history, loaded a day at a time as the window nears it). Drawn with Microsoft.Maui.Graphics, theme-aware.",
